  "reason": "Uniform target-position sampling gives the final training interaction probability only 1/(len(history)-1), potentially underrepresenting the long, recent prefixes used for validation. Modify only training-example construction to isolate the proposed 50/50 mixture; the observed macro HR@10 of 0.475 versus SASRec's 0.505 motivates investigation without establishing causality. Historical failures of recency-weighted supervision favor preserving uniform coverage, loss weighting, and the current architecture while testing this specific sampling hypothesis.",
